        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>LCN 4040XP Door Closer  \"Super Smoothee\" </b>\r\n<p>\r\nThe LCN 4040XP heavy duty, double-lever arm door closer designed for institutional and other high traffic applications. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe wide choice of options, installation accessories and ease of installation offer maximum versatility. The LCN 4040XP is UL - and ULC-listed for self-closing doors without hold-open. Note: LCN changed the part number on this closer from P4041 to P4040XP in October 2011.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nTested and certified under ANSI Standard A156.4 Grade One. Optional \r\n<a href=\"/products/hold-open-arm-for-lcn-4040-series-lcn-4040xp3049\"><b>Hold-Open Arm</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/cush-n-stop-arm-for-lcn-4040-series-lcn-4040xp3077cns\"><b>Cushion Arm</b></a> or \r\n<a href=\"/products/hold-open-cush-n-stop-arm-for-lcn-4040-series-lcn-4040xp3049cns\"><b>Cushion Hold Open Arm</b></a> available. The LCN  SUPER SMOOTHEE is LCN's most flexible heavy duty closer, non-sized cylinder for interior doors up to 5' and exterior doors up to 4'. Tri packed for regular, top jamb or parallel arm mounting.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/lcn-super-smoothee-track-arm-door-closer-lcn-4040xpt\"><b>LCN 4040XPT with track arm</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/4041_closer_dimensions.gif?v=1704352994\" width=\"369\" height=\"180\" border=\"0\" alt=\"LCN 4041 Door Closer Mounting Holes\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the LCN 4040XP Door Closer:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Adjustable closing speed</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable latching speed</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable back check</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Size: 60\" Interior / 48\" Exterior</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Weight: 258 lbs</li>\r\n<li>Spring Tension: Adjustable 1-6</li>\r\n<li>LCN \"Green Dial\" Spring Force Indicator</li>\r\n<li><b>Tri packed for regular, top jamb or parallel arm mounting</b></li>\r\n<li>Non Handed</li>\r\n<li><b>Optional Hold Open and Cushion Arm</b></li>\r\n<li><b>Grade 1</b> for Ten Million Cycles</li>\r\n<li>Cast Iron Housing</li>\r\n<li>Forged Steel Arm</li>\r\n<li>Double Heat Treated Steel Pinion</li>\r\n<li>All Weather Fluid</li>\r\n<li>UL & cUL Listed</li>\r\n<li>30 Year Warranty</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/4040.pdf?v=1704262192\" target=\"new\"><b>LCN4041 Information (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA Compliant</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>NOTE: the standard arm shown in the upper right product image is already included.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nOptional  <a href=\"/products/hold-open-arm-for-lcn-4040-series-lcn-4040xp3049\"><b>Hold-Open Arm</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/cush-n-stop-arm-for-lcn-4040-series-lcn-4040xp3077cns\"><b>Cushion Arm</b></a> or \r\n<a href=\"/products/hold-open-cush-n-stop-arm-for-lcn-4040-series-lcn-4040xp3049cns\"><b>Hold-Open Cushion Arm</b></a>  are available.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-3001-size.gif?v=1704354504\" width=\"450\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Closer Accessories\">\r\n</p>",
