                "description": "LCN 4040XP Series Door Closer. The LCN P4041XP Super Smoothee. A heavy-duty, double-lever arm closer designed for institutional and other high traffic applications. The wide choice of options, installation accessories and ease of installation offer maximum versatility. UL - and ULC-listed for self-closing doors without hold-open. Tested and certified under ANSI Standard A156.4 Grade One. Optional Hold-Open arm available. \r\n",
